"logic.code.cap" = "Walks the selected objects, down into groups and compound paths.¶Sets strokeCap to StrokeCap.%CAP% on paths with a stroke only; unstroked paths and other objects are left as they are.";
"logic.code.openPath" = "Looks at whether the first selected object is text.¶Text: adds Convert to Shape › Rectangle (Adobe Shape Effects, extra width/height 0).¶Adds Transform (Adobe Transform, vertical 0%, reference point center).¶Adds Pathfinder › Outline below it (Adobe Pathfinder Command 6, keeping unpainted artwork). Both go under the contents, Transform above Outline.¶Text: plays the recorded action “Set Stroke” (1 pt, round cap) as a temporary action. Paths: sets round caps (StrokeCap.ROUNDENDCAP).";
"logic.code.pasteLastStyle" = "Checks doc.graphicStyles; with none, shows “The document has no graphic styles.” and stops.¶Applies the last graphic style in the list (graphicStyles[length - 1]) to each selected object with applyTo().";
"logic.code.expandUngroup" = "app.executeMenuCommand(\"expandStyle\"): Object › Expand Appearance.¶app.executeMenuCommand(\"ungroup\"): Ungroup.¶app.executeMenuCommand(\"deselectall\"): Deselect.";
